# Miner's Guidewing: "When this creature dies, target creature you control explores." (CR 701.44a) Bot1's Guidewing is killed by its own
# Lightning Bolt in Bot2's end step. The trigger's target must be a creature Bot1 controls: Bot2's Ornithopter and Bot1's Mox Pearl are
# refused, Bot1's Memnite is chosen (not its Ornithopter). The nonland card on top (a second Memnite) is revealed: only the chosen Memnite gets
# the +1/+1 counter (a 2/2), and Bot1, offered the card, puts it into the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Miner's Guidewing
Memnite
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Island
Memnite
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

